WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.590
Okay, Ghostface, will you do the honors?

2
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:07.819
Please welcome Jack Quaid.

3
00:00:07.819 --> 00:00:09.954
(audience cheers)

4
00:00:09.954 --> 00:00:10.787
Hello!

5
00:00:11.768 --> 00:00:13.227
Hi.

6
00:00:13.227 --> 00:00:14.490
Hi.

7
00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.140
Casey Becker, it's so nice to officially meet you.

8
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:19.640
Oh my gosh, it is so nice to officially meet you.

9
00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.520
Now, I can't give any spoilers away,

10
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.520
but boy, it's exciting to talk to you about this movie.

11
00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.470
You are so incredible in it.

12
00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:32.090
Coming from you, that means a lot.

13
00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:34.570
Thank you so much, Drew, that's insane.

14
00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:37.480
Thank you, yeah we had so much fun making this movie,

15
00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.030 line:15%
and we're just really excited that it's getting,

16
00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:42.340 line:15%
a lot of fans seem to love it.

17
00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:45.250 line:15%
You know, this is for the hardcore "Scream" fans,

18
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.000
and we're just so excited that people finally get to see it.

19
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.620
And to be honest with you,

20
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:53.280
I never thought I would be in a "Scream" movie ever,

21
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.940
because when I was about four years old,

22
00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:57.450
the original "Scream" had just come out,

23
00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.600 line:15%
I think I was trick or treating

24
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.190 line:15%
for the very first time in my neighborhood,

25
00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:03.430 line:15%
and it was a big year for Ghostface.

26
00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.990 line:15%
Every other kid on that block was dressed as Ghostface,

27
00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:10.020
and I remember seeing this one kid with,

28
00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:12.160
and I've seen it since, it's like a Ghostface mask

29
00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:14.510
that's kind of translucent, you can see through it,

30
00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:17.600
and you can pump fake blood down it so it runs down,

31
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.870
and when I saw that for the first time,

32
00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:21.930
I was like, oh, no thank you at all,

33
00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:24.400
I don't want to see that ever again,

34
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.680
and it got me off of scary movies

35
00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:29.120
and horror movies in general for years.

36
00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:31.600
I didn't start watching them until I was a teenager,

37
00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:36.600
and then I finally saw "Scream" and it's just so cool.

38
00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:40.090
I love that it's a horror movie for horror fans.

39
00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:41.880
Well, I will say,

40
00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:45.650
as someone who knows the franchise so well,

41
00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:48.610
and knows the fans' perspective as well,

42
00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:51.510
this one does not disappoint,

43
00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:53.262
and a lot of it has to do with everybody in it,

44
00:01:53.262 --> 00:01:54.580
(audience cheers)
including you,

45
00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:58.270
Jack, you're so good.
Thank you.

46
00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:03.040
Now, Courteney and Neve and David were just here.

47
00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:05.370
I've known David literally my entire life,

48
00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:06.890
and apparently I'm not the only one.

49
00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:07.960
You know David
Yeah.

50
00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.280
prior to filming?

51
00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:13.120
I met David when I was about six years old.

52
00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:14.370 line:15%
I don't remember it too well,

53
00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.230 line:15%
