54
00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:18.800 line:15%
to dinner at his house somehow,

55
00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.690 line:15%
and I remember I was really, really young,

56
00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:24.790 line:15%
and I remember, dinner parties,

57
00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.350 line:15%
