58
00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:30.350 line:15%
and I think someone just showed me to David's game room.

59
00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.420
He had all these video games and cool things

60
00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.370
that as a kid, I think I played Super Nintendo

61
00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:38.063
at his house when I was like six years old.

62
00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:41.320
David, I love how he-

63
00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:42.670
I don't know if you saw his documentary,

64
00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:45.150
his amazing documentary, "You Cannot Kill David Arquette",

65
00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:48.273
but when I saw him again for this,

66
00:02:49.481 --> 00:02:52.400
I was so excited and I went up to him, and I'm like-

67
00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.780
It's really hard to compliment somebody

68
00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.060
