84
00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.680
Yeah, he's the new Bozo the Clown now, it's amazing.

85
00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.450
Like, I don't know what he can't do.

86
00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.660
There's nothing he can't do.

87
